<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Visual Experiments on Romain Thomas</title><link>https://www.romainthomas.fr/projects-images/</link><description>Recent visual experiments from Romain Thomas</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.romainthomas.fr/projects-images/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>DroidGuard</title><link>https://www.romainthomas.fr/projects-images/safetynet/</link><pubDate>Thu, 11 Nov 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.romainthomas.fr/projects-images/safetynet/</guid><description>DroidGuard / SafetyNet bypass</description><content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;This is a PoC that shows basic integrity bypass &lt;strong&gt;without MagiskHide&lt;/strong&gt; by modifying the execution of DroidGuard.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;video controls preload="metadata" aria-label="Embedded research demonstration"&gt;&#10; &lt;source src="https://data.romainthomas.fr/2021-11-11-droidguard-safetynet-demo.mp4" type="video/mp4"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;p&gt;Your browser cannot play this video. &lt;a href="https://data.romainthomas.fr/2021-11-11-droidguard-safetynet-demo.mp4"&gt;Download the recording&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/video&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Here are, for instance, some modules detected by DroidGuard:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;frida-agent-32.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;frida-agent-64.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;libarthook_native.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;libfrida-gadget.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;libmemtrack_real.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;librfbinder-cpp.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;libriru_edxp.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;libriru_edxposed.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;libriru_snet-tweak-riru.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;libsandhook-native.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;libsandhook.edxp.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;libsandhook.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;libva++.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;libva-native.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;libwhale.edxp.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;libxposed_art.so&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content:encoded></item></channel></rss>